'''''Antitrichia''''' is a genus of [[mosses]] belonging to the family [[Leucodontaceae]] with a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Antitrichia Brid. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2678390 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=17 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

==Species==
The following species are recognised in the genus ''Antitrichia'':<ref name="GBIF" />
* ''[[Antitrichia californica]]'' <small>Sullivant</small>
* ''[[Antitrichia curtipendula]]'' <small>Bridel</small>
* ''[[Antitrichia kilimandscharica]]'' <small>Brotherus</small>
* ''[[Antitrichia pseudocalifornia]]'' <small>Kindb.</small>

